  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mimeta - Human rights as vector for culture sector development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective is to support the development of the cultural sector in the MENA and Sub-Saharan Africa regions with focus on cultural rights and artistic freedom, and with particular focus on gender equality and women. The grant shall contribute to improve the cultural sectors&#xb4; position on rights issues, in political and legal matters, the professionalism, the distribution of the arts and the sustainability of the sector.</narrative>
  </description>
